  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_title": "什么是Open Food Facts？",
  "guide_open_food_facts_what_is_open_food_facts_paragraph1": "Open Food Facts 是一个**协作式**、**免费**、**开放**的全球食品数据库。",
